{
  "name": "dsh-persona-grow",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness 人格生长插件：每轮对话结束后自动三段分流（人格 / 经历 / 丢弃），判断时能看见现有档案，可合并、可推翻旧认知，条目随时间衰减、被印证则回升。带身份锁：identity.md 里的名字与形象每轮完整注入、不吃预算、不衰减，locked 条目工具删不掉也推不翻。人格与经历存在一个自包含文件夹里，换机器拷过去就复活。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "engines": {
      "dsh": ">=0.2.0-rc.2"
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22.19.0"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "persona",
    "cordis"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": ">=4.0.0 <5",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": ">=3.18.0 <4"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}